IT:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Ah, è solo un raffreddore!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Sicuramente passerà da solo,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
non preoccuparti! {{TAG:0003:001E:}}{{TAG:0007:000A:}}Ecciù!

{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Grazie per la visita!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Le tue parole sono meglio di
qualsiasi {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}medicina{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}A cold like this shouldn't really do
anything to me.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0026:}}Thanks for the 
concern anyway, though!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Un rhume comme celui-ci, ça n'est
rien.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0026:}}Mais merci de t'inquiéter pour
moi !{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Bah, non sarà certo questo
raffreddorino da strapazzo a
mettermi in crisi.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0026:}}Comunque grazie!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

